	(text "NOTE 1: Datasheet ratings VoL_{MAX}=0.7V and IoL/IoH=±20mA_{MAX}\n	Assuming the LED drops 2V, VR_{LED}=2.3V.\n	R_{LED} = 2.3V/20mA_{MAX} = 115Ω_{MIN}\n	I_{LED} = 2.3V/240Ω = 9.583mA\nNOTE 2: D3 was tested with a 1N4148 general purpose diode.\n	Any equivelant GP diode should be sufficient.\nNOTE 3: I^{2}C resistors are set to 470Ω by default to preserve signal\n	fidelity, but can be adjusted UP TO 4.7kΩ as seen fit."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 36.83 195.58 0)
